{"4794780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GnomeBoozled", "steam_appid": 4794780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your backyard into an illegal gnome disposal business and feed a mysterious hole for profit. What starts as a simple side hustle quickly spirals into a chaotic absurdity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t let their goofy looks fool you gnomes are anything but friendly. Once awakened, they’ll curse at you, spit in your face, sabotage your machinery, and steal your hard earned profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build absurd traps, conveyor systems, and bizarre contraptions to automate disposal and keep your operation running at maximum efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4794780/extras/d0164f32c2d1101d55ec009aa77c4039.poster.avif?t=1787585214\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4794780/extras/d0164f32c2d1101d55ec009aa77c4039.webm?t=1787585214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4794780/extras/d0164f32c2d1101d55ec009aa77c4039.mp4?t=1787585214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your profits on powerful upgrades, unlock new tools, and expand beyond your backyard into the surrounding neighborhood as your shady business grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4794780/extras/15f26d3b67de7d363c1026b5ed90a298.poster.avif?t=1787585214\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4794780/extras/15f26d3b67de7d363c1026b5ed90a298.webm?t=1787585214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4794780/extras/15f26d3b67de7d363c1026b5ed90a298.mp4?t=1787585214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more gnomes you feed to the hole, the bigger and hungrier it becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4794780/extras/c6a8c2d93d599eb1bb54c3eedc76be3c.poster.avif?t=1787585214\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4794780/extras/c6a8c2d93d599eb1bb54c3eedc76be3c.webm?t=1787585214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4794780/extras/c6a8c2d93d599eb1bb54c3eedc76be3c.mp4?t=1787585214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As magical creatures, gnomes occasionally drop enchanted mushrooms that grant powerful bonuses—boost combo potential, increase movement speed, or unleash even more chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person physics sandbox with incremental progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story about the strange hole and the mischievous gnomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of unlockable tools to improve your efficiency over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living backyard and whole surrounding neighbourhood to explore and automate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gnome statues that become alive and cause chaos, with variety of personalities and goals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying combo system with escalating audiovisual feedback that rewards skillful play</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your backyard into an illegal gnome disposal business and feed a mysterious hole for profit. What starts as a simple side hustle quickly spirals into a chaotic absurdity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t let their goofy looks fool you gnomes are anything but friendly. Once awakened, they’ll curse at you, spit in your face, sabotage your machinery, and steal your hard earned profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build absurd traps, conveyor systems, and bizarre contraptions to automate disposal and keep your operation running at maximum efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4794780/extras/d0164f32c2d1101d55ec009aa77c4039.poster.avif?t=1787585214\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4794780/extras/d0164f32c2d1101d55ec009aa77c4039.webm?t=1787585214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4794780/extras/d0164f32c2d1101d55ec009aa77c4039.mp4?t=1787585214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your profits on powerful upgrades, unlock new tools, and expand beyond your backyard into the surrounding neighborhood as your shady business grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4794780/extras/15f26d3b67de7d363c1026b5ed90a298.poster.avif?t=1787585214\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4794780/extras/15f26d3b67de7d363c1026b5ed90a298.webm?t=1787585214\" type=\"video/webm